    {
      "id": "height-analysis",
      "kind": "content",
      "headline": "AVL树的高度：严格O(log n)",
      "lead": "最小节点数满足斐波那契关系，从而导出高度上界",
      "notes": "理论证明",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "b9_1",
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "\\begin{aligned} N(h) &= N(h-1) + N(h-2) + 1, \\quad h \\ge 2 \\\\ N(0) &= 1, \\ N(1) = 2 \\\\ N(h) &= F_{h+3} - 1 \\quad (F_0=0, F_1=1) \\\\ F_{h+3} &\\ge \\phi^{h+1} \\ (\\phi = \\frac{1+\\sqrt{5}}{2}) \\\\ n+1 &\\ge F_{h+3} \\ge \\phi^{h+1} \\\\ n+2 &> n+1 \\ge \\phi^{h+1} \\Rightarrow h \\le \\log_{\\phi}(n+2)-1 \\\\ h &\\le \\log_{\\phi}(n+2)-1 \\approx 1.44 \\log_2(n+2)-1 \\end{aligned}",
          "caption": "AVL树的最小节点数递推关系与高度上界。$h$ 为边数高度（从根到叶子的边数）。由递推可得 $N(h)=F_{h+3}-1$，利用斐波那契通项 $F_k \\ge \\phi^{k-2}$（$\\phi$ 为黄金比例）可导出 $h \\le \\log_{\\phi}(n+2)-1 \\approx 1.44 \\log_2(n+2)-1$。"
        },
        {
